* eval_fixed -- compiles and evaluates the expression 'X + 1' at run time, 1000 times.
* bottleneck: run-time compilation of a fixed expression string.
        X = 10
        i = 1
loop    result = EVAL('X + 1')
        i = LT(i, 1000) i + 1                           :S(loop)
        OUTPUT = "EVAL('X + 1') = " result
END
